      "message": "This looks complete to me for BPF maps: array, ring buffer, user ring buffer and arena maps only reach `map-\u003eops-\u003emap_mmap()` through `bpf_map_mmap()`, and refusing here, before `bpf_map_write_active_inc()` and the `vm_ops` setup, leaves nothing to undo.\n\nThe only other bpf `mmap()` I can find is `btf_sysfs_vmlinux_mmap()`, which aosp/4393907 refuses separately in p3s_6.18_b16. Would it make sense to fold that patch into this one, so that the bpf `mmap()` refusals land together?",
